    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed</strong> is a cozy idle-mining simulator that quietly runs on your screen. Guide a lone dwarf miner as he digs through the cursed lands beneath the world of Sin Slayers\u2014collecting gems and uncovering the darkness below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig through cursed lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip away at rock\u2014gathering valuable gems buried deep beneath forgotten battlefields and haunted crypts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect gems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides new surprises. Use your findings to unlock fresh mining zones, upgrade gear, and keep the dig going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned loot on stronger pickaxes, faster digging, and a bigger backpack. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle-friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed runs quietly at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day. Whether you're working, studying, or slaying sins elsewhere, your miner keeps digging.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed</strong> is a cozy idle-mining simulator that quietly runs on your screen. Guide a lone dwarf miner as he digs through the cursed lands beneath the world of Sin Slayers\u2014collecting gems and uncovering the darkness below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig through cursed lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip away at rock\u2014gathering valuable gems buried deep beneath forgotten battlefields and haunted crypts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect gems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides new surprises. Use your findings to unlock fresh mining zones, upgrade gear, and keep the dig going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned loot on stronger pickaxes, faster digging, and a bigger backpack. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle-friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed runs quietly at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day. Whether you're working, studying, or slaying sins elsewhere, your miner keeps digging.</p>",
    "short_description": "A chill idle-mining sim that lives on your desktop. Dig rocks, collect gems, buy upgrades, feed your greed, and uncover shiny surprises while you do other things.",
